---
import "../../r5.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f0e9" />
  <meta name="description" content="Create a browser game, try a small playable starter, and send an avocadoMini game or product idea for private review." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://avocadomini.si/create/" />
  <title>Create games — avocadoMini</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" type="image/png" />
  <script is:inline src="/site-enhancements.js" defer></script>
  <script is:inline src="/create.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="r5-page creator-page">
  <a class="skip" href="#main-content">Skip to creator studio</a>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="https://avocadomini.si/" aria-label="avocadoMini home"><img src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" />avokado</a>
    <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Creator navigation"><a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="#starter">Play & build</a><a href="#submit">Send an idea</a><a href="/preorder/">Product status</a></nav>
    <div class="header-actions"><details class="site-menu"><summary>Menu</summary><div class="site-menu-panel"><p>CREATE WITH AVOCADOMINI</p><nav aria-label="Creator menu"><a href="#how-it-works"><strong>How it works</strong></a><a href="#starter"><strong>Play & build</strong></a><a href="#submit"><strong>Send an idea</strong></a><a href="/preorder/"><strong>Product status</strong></a></nav></div></details><a class="header-cta" href="https://avocadomini.si/">Back to Mini ↗</a></div>
  </header>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="creator-hero" aria-labelledby="creator-title">
      <picture class="creator-hero-image"><img src="/images/avocadomini-r5-game-creator-hero-v1.jpg" width="1774" height="887" alt="Concept scene showing the slim silver avocadoMini beside a vivid game on a standard screen" fetchpriority="high" /></picture>
      <div class="creator-hero-content"><p class="eyebrow">AVOCADOMINI / OPEN CREATOR PREVIEW</p><h1 id="creator-title">Make a world.<br /><em>Make it yours.</em></h1><p class="lead">Imagine the game you would love to play. Try a live browser starter, build your own version, and send a demo or idea to shape what comes next.</p><div class="creator-actions"><a class="button" href="#starter">Start making ↓</a><a class="text-link" href="#submit">Share a game idea ↗</a></div><p class="creator-hero-note">Mini product concept image · Browser creator preview available now</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="creator-product-story" aria-labelledby="creator-product-title"><div class="creator-product-intro"><p class="eyebrow">THE PRODUCT BEHIND THE IDEA</p><h2 id="creator-product-title">A small form.<br /><em>Room for new play.</em></h2><p>Meet the current avocadoMini design direction: a slim, removable silver device for everyday spaces. We are opening the creative door early so makers can help explore what should come next.</p><a class="text-link" href="/mini/">Explore the Mini concept ↗</a></div><figure class="creator-product-card"><img src="/images/avocadomini-r5-slim-form-reference.png" width="1306" height="1204" loading="lazy" alt="Current concept form: a slender silver avocadoMini with a black sensor band on a low round dock" /><figcaption><span>01 / FORM</span><strong>The Mini itself.</strong><p>Slender silver body, black sensor band, low dock.</p></figcaption></figure><figure class="creator-product-card"><img src="/images/avocadomini-r5-removable-dock-concept.png" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" alt="Concept scene of a hand lifting the slim avocadoMini from a reachable wall dock" /><figcaption><span>02 / PLACE</span><strong>At home. Within reach.</strong><p>A removable direction for spaces where play and daily life meet.</p></figcaption></figure><p class="creator-product-disclaimer">Concept imagery, not evidence of a finished device or accepted game runtime. Today's creator tools run in the browser. Submitted games are not published automatically. We review them privately.</p></section>
    <section id="how-it-works" class="creator-steps" aria-labelledby="creator-steps-title"><p class="eyebrow">A PATH FOR CREATORS</p><h2 id="creator-steps-title">Play. Change. Share.</h2><div><article><span>01 / TRY</span><h3>Test the loop.</h3><p>Play a small tap game in this browser. No account, download, or payment.</p></article><article><span>02 / BUILD</span><h3>Make it yours.</h3><p>Change the title, time, pace, and color. Export a small game manifest or download the open HTML/JavaScript starter to build further.</p></article><article><span>03 / PROPOSE</span><h3>Send a demo.</h3><p>Host your own game, then send a public HTTPS demo and optional source link for private review. An idea without code is welcome too.</p></article></div></section>
    <section id="starter" class="creator-starter" aria-labelledby="creator-starter-title"><div class="creator-starter-copy"><p class="eyebrow">PLAYABLE BROWSER STARTER</p><h2 id="creator-starter-title">A game you can change<br />in a minute.</h2><p>Catch the moving light before time runs out. This starter demonstrates a simple input, state, score, and restart loop. It is a browser demo, not a Mini hardware test.</p><form id="game-builder"><label>Game title<input name="gameTitle" id="game-title" maxlength="60" value="Catch the Light" required /></label><label>Round length<select name="duration" id="game-duration"><option value="30">30 seconds</option><option value="45">45 seconds</option><option value="60">60 seconds</option></select></label><label>Pace<select name="pace" id="game-pace"><option value="calm">Calm</option><option value="steady" selected>Steady</option><option value="quick">Quick</option></select></label><label>Accent color<input name="accent" id="game-accent" type="color" value="#9ed8aa" /></label><div class="creator-builder-actions"><button type="button" id="game-start" class="button">Start game</button><button type="button" id="game-export" class="creator-secondary">Export manifest</button></div></form><a class="text-link" href="/downloads/mini-browser-game-starter.zip" download>Download the open starter kit ↗</a><p class="creator-small">The starter is plain HTML/JavaScript. Its manifest describes this demo only; it is not a production Mini game package or the Wallet exchange SDK.</p></div><div class="creator-play-wrap"><div class="creator-play-head"><strong id="preview-title">Catch the Light</strong><span>Score <b id="game-score">0</b> · <b id="game-time">30</b>s</span></div><div id="game-arena" class="creator-arena" aria-label="Tap game preview"><button type="button" id="game-target" class="creator-target" aria-label="Catch the light" disabled hidden></button><p id="game-message" role="status">Press “Start game” to play.</p></div><p>Pointer, touch, or keyboard activation works. Press Start again to restart.</p></div></section>
    <section id="submit" class="creator-submit" aria-labelledby="creator-submit-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRIVATE REVIEW QUEUE</p><h2 id="creator-submit-title">Send what you want<br />to see built.</h2><p>Send a product improvement or a link to your own game demo. We keep submissions private while reviewing them. Sending one does not publish it, promise implementation, create a sale, or grant game runtime access.</p><p class="creator-small">Do not include personal details, passwords, private source code, or material you cannot share. You keep ownership of your work.</p></div><div class="creator-submit-panel"><form id="creator-submission"><label>What are you sending?<select name="kind" id="submission-kind"><option value="idea">Product idea or improvement</option><option value="game">Game demo for review</option></select></label><label>Title<input name="title" minlength="5" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Give it a clear name" /></label><label id="category-field">Area<select name="category" id="submission-category"><option value="play">Play and games</option><option value="accessibility">Accessibility</option><option value="creation">Creation and work</option><option value="device">Device and controls</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></label><label>What should it do?<textarea name="description" minlength="20" maxlength="2000" rows="5" required placeholder="Describe the action, who it helps, and what success looks like."></textarea></label><label id="demo-field" hidden>Public HTTPS game demo<input name="demoUrl" id="submission-demo" type="url" maxlength="300" placeholder="https://example.com/my-game" /></label><label id="source-field" hidden>Public source link (optional)<input name="sourceUrl" id="submission-source" type="url" maxlength="300" placeholder="https://github.com/you/my-game" /></label><label class="creator-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label><label class="creator-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="reviewConsent" required />I can share this text or link for private review and understand it will not be published automatically.</label><button class="button" type="submit" id="submission-button">Send for review ↗</button><p id="submission-status" class="creator-form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">No account or payment required.</p></form><div id="submission-receipt" class="creator-receipt" hidden><h3>Received for review.</h3><p>Save these codes. The removal code is shown only here; it lets you remove your submission later.</p><div><label>Receipt ID<input id="receipt-id" readonly /></label><label>Removal code<input id="removal-code" readonly /></label></div><button type="button" id="receipt-copy" class="creator-secondary">Copy receipt and removal code</button></div></div></section>
    <section class="creator-removal" aria-labelledby="creator-removal-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR CONTROL</p><h2 id="creator-removal-title">Remove a submission.</h2><p>Enter both codes from your receipt. Removal deletes the submission from the review database. The codes are not placed in a URL.</p></div><form id="creator-remove"><label>Receipt ID<input name="id" required autocomplete="off" /></label><label>Removal code<input name="removalCode" required autocomplete="off" /></label><button type="submit" class="creator-secondary">Remove my submission</button><p id="remove-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section>
    <section class="creator-next"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT COMES LATER</p><h2>Build together.<br />Prove it before release.</h2><p>Creator-submitted games need rights review, compatibility testing, accessibility, security isolation, and an accepted device/runtime before they can appear in a product catalog. The existing synthetic Game/Wallet SDK is separate from this browser starter and does not authorize real money exchange.</p><div><a class="button" href="https://github.com/k999ln/rock">Explore the development repository ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/preorder/">See Mini development status ↗</a></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer><div><strong>avokado</strong><span>© 2026 AVOKADO LLC</span></div><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="https://avocadomini.si/">avocadoMini</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/preorder/">Product status</a><a href="https://avoado.si/">Sky & services</a><a href="https://avocadopro.si/">avocadoPro</a></nav></footer>
</body>
</html>
